[For "black"]
[Kind "sideline"]
[Start "caro-advance 3...Bf5"]
[Name "Advance: 4.Bd3"]

4. Bd3 { Offers the same swap a move earlier. }
4... Bxd3 { Takes: White's best minor piece comes off, and the queen is pulled forward. }
5. Qxd3 e6 { Supports d5. The light squares in White's camp are short of a guard now. }
6. Nf3 { The main line's position, by another order: ...c5 next. } *
